# Alcove upgrade overrides
# List variable names (one per line) whose template value should
# ALWAYS replace the user's existing value during upgrade.
# Blank lines and lines starting with # are ignored.
#
# Example:
# SEARCH_REFERENCES_ENABLED
SEARCH_REFERENCES_ENABLED

# Auto-discovered from tools/ directory — force empty list on upgrade
LOADED_TOOL_LOCATIONS

# Recalibrated for bge-m3 (1024-dim) — old 0.65 value tuned for MiniLM
# (384-dim) let everything through bge-m3's tighter distance band.
SEARCH_REFERENCES_DISTANCE_THRESHOLD
